# Groq (default). Replace the key below only in your local .env.
LLM_PROVIDER=groq
LLM_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
LLM_BASE_URL=

SEARCH_MAX_DISTANCE=0.60

# OpenAI: set LLM_PROVIDER=openai and use your OpenAI key/model above.
# Other compatible providers: set LLM_PROVIDER=openai_compatible,
# then set LLM_API_KEY, LLM_MODEL and LLM_BASE_URL to that provider's values.
# LLM_BASE_URL is the API base URL, without /chat/completions.


#### OpenAI

```dotenv
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
LLM_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key
LLM_MODEL=your_model_name
LLM_BASE_URL=
SEARCH_MAX_DISTANCE=0.60
```

#### Other OpenAI-compatible providers

```dotenv
LLM_PROVIDER=openai_compatible
LLM_API_KEY=your_provider_api_key
LLM_MODEL=your_provider_model_name
LLM_BASE_URL=https://provider.example/v1
SEARCH_MAX_DISTANCE=0.60
```

Replace all placeholders with your provider's actual settings.
For `openai_compatible`, provide the API base URL without
`/chat/completions`.

The selected model must support Chat Completions JSON mode
(`json_object`). Providers using other API formats are not
directly supported.

Restart the server after changing `.env`.